    "Press ⌥⌘D at any time — that’s macOS’s own shortcut for showing and hiding the Dock. You can also change this later from the Tungsten Edge menu bar item.": {
      "comment": "⚠️ ⌥⌘D 归 macOS 所有，钨极只把它当纯文字写、绝不注册成 keyEquivalent（会抢掉系统的）。钨极自己的全局热键是 ⌥⇧⌘D，别写混。",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Press ⌥⌘D at any time — that’s macOS’s own shortcut for showing and hiding the Dock. You can also change this later from the Tungsten Edge menu bar item."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "随时按 ⌥⌘D 就能唤回来——这是 macOS 自带的 Dock 显隐快捷键。也可以之后从钨极的状态栏菜单里改。"
