    "This sets the Dock to hide itself and stay hidden, so it won’t pop up when you move the pointer to the bottom edge. The Dock restarts, so the screen will flash once.": {
      "comment": "「不唤醒」是 owner 2026-08-20 定的推荐档位（对应 AppSettingsStore.neverWakeDelay）。文案要把「会闪一下」说在前面——用户没预期的闪烁会被当成 bug。",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This sets the Dock to hide itself and stay hidden, so it won’t pop up when you move the pointer to the bottom edge. The Dock restarts, so the screen will flash once."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点下面的按钮，钨极会把系统 Dock 设成自动隐藏，而且鼠标碰到底边也不会把它唤出来。写入时系统 Dock 会重启一下，屏幕会闪一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will only take a moment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "马上就好。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This will only take a moment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Timed out while reading": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取超时"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Timed out while reading"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To keep the taskbar from flashing when you switch into full screen, Tungsten Edge has to hide it before your input reaches the app. It therefore watches global left-clicks, key presses and trackpad gestures, and recognizes only four of them: the window’s green button, Control-Command-F, Control-Left/Right arrow, and a three-finger horizontal swipe. What you type is never recorded, logged, or sent anywhere. Turning this off disables the watching completely.": {
      "comment": "隐私披露。必须与两份 README 里枚举的四种输入保持一致（AGENTS.md 有护栏）。",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为了不让任务条在切进全屏时闪一下，钨极需要在你的输入送到应用之前先把它藏起来。因此会监听全局的鼠标左键按下、键盘按下和触控板手势，只识别窗口绿灯、Control-Command-F、Control-左右方向键和三指水平滑动这四种；不记录输入内容，也不写日志、不发送到任何地方。关闭后这些监听会被完全停用。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To keep the taskbar from flashing when you switch into full screen, Tungsten Edge has to hide it before your input reaches the app. It therefore watches global left-clicks, key presses and trackpad gestures, and recognizes only four of them: the window’s green button, Control-Command-F, Control-Left/Right arrow, and a three-finger horizontal swipe. What you type is never recorded, logged, or sent anywhere. Turning this off disables the watching completely."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tungsten Edge": {
      "comment": "钨极组的分组标题（热键未注册时）。中文界面带品牌后缀「钨极」，英文只用产品名。",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tungsten Edge 钨极"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tungsten Edge"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tungsten Edge (⌥⇧⌘D to show/hide)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
